<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 12-MAY					     .</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 12-MAY					     .</headline>
<text>
<p>Cleanup continues along the Red River in the upper Plains of the USA and in southern Manitoba, Canada, near Winnepeg. The next chance for moderate rain in the area does not come until late in the week. Rainfall so far this month has averaged below normal.</p>
</text>
